%% Pehra agent workflow. agent-workflow.svg is drawn from this by hand, in the same layout.
flowchart TD
  P["Perception, OpenCV 5, every analysed frame<br/>MOG2, YOLOX on cv2.dnn, Kalman tracker, zones and lines,<br/>DIS flow, pose, YuNet and SFace, plates, zone state, camera health"]
  R{"Watch engine: do a watch's<br/>signals and conditions hold?"}
  NOTHING["Nothing is sent anywhere"]
  FACE["Named by an enrolled face:<br/>alert, no AI"]
  HEALTH["Camera health: warning incident<br/>at once, no AI"]
  CRIT["Critical: incident opened and posted<br/>to Telegram before the check, 'Possible'"]
  HOLD["Same camera and watch cleared or marked<br/>false a moment ago: held, checked first"]
  V["Verifier agent: sees the watch, its question,<br/>what OpenCV saw, frames and the best crop"]
  T["OpenCV tools: get_frames, crop_zoom,<br/>enhance (CLAHE, denoise), motion_trail,<br/>flow (DIS), pose_history"]
  A["raise_alert with a grade and a reason"]
  D["dismiss with a reason"]
  H["ask_human"]
  C["cannot_judge: needs an age,<br/>posted unchecked"]
  F["AI fails, times out or hits its cap:<br/>critical goes out unverified"]
  I["Incident: Telegram message edited,<br/>reminders until acknowledged"]
  G["Guards on Telegram: Acknowledge or False alarm<br/>(a label; quiets only that trigger)"]

  P --> R
  R -- no --> NOTHING
  R -- yes --> FACE
  R -- yes --> HEALTH
  R -- yes --> CRIT
  R -- yes --> HOLD
  R -- yes --> V
  CRIT --> V
  HOLD --> V
  V -- "one JSON tool call per step" --> T
  T -- "result and new pictures change the next step" --> V
  V --> A
  V --> D
  V --> H
  V --> C
  V --> F
  A --> I
  H --> I
  C --> I
  F --> I
  FACE --> I
  HEALTH --> I
  I --> G
  G -- "changes what is posted next" --> I
